    "Audience": "api://243ea5dc-2187-44aa-aa62-3d303608be53/.default",
    "// ClientSecret": "NOT set here and never should be. Supplied from kv-orig-eus as secret 'Ctrm--ClientSecret' (Key Vault maps '--' to ':'), read by the app-origination-eus managed identity at STARTUP - the CTRM client and its credential are a singleton built once, so the secret must exist in the vault BEFORE the restart that turns CTRM on. If it lands afterwards, restart again."
